  <item>
    <title>禁止呼吸vol.6_两个记性不好的人的春节记忆</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6798a0b0d74435e4a33459e1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6798a0b0d74435e4a33459e1</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Jan 2025 09:24:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：列缺/绿绿</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：列缺</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主题为春节漫谈，是暌违已久的更新，不过两位主播本就没有的录播客技能更加退化了，有很多内容没有深入探讨，比较可惜，也没出什么梗。</span></p><span></span><p><span>不过好歹蹭上了春节，祝大家蛇年快乐，彩票中奖，大便通畅。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="79">00:01:19</a> 两位主播今年期待过年吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>—压岁钱与负罪感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">00:07:40</a> 春节吃什么</span></p><span></span><p><span>—poor鸡poor猪poor肠胃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1047">00:17:27</a> 祭祖环节</span></p><span></span><p><span>—我也不知道为什么这段全程在笑，没有冒犯之意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1273">00:21:13</a> 蹴鞠人有自己的春晚</span></p><span></span><p><span>—春晚无聊？大年初二欧冠比赛，让所有人热热闹闹过大年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1766">00:29:26</a> 印象比较深的春节</span></p><span></span><p><span>—希望大家都能有自由的独自过春节记忆</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期BGM：龙年春晚经典新歌</span></p>]]></description>
