    <title>禁止呼吸vol.2_期望、告别与爱：从声音玩具演唱会归来</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66225fe6200abebe6ef5dd8d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66225fe6200abebe6ef5dd8d</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 19 Apr 2024 12:13:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：列缺/绿绿</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：列缺</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面图：柏舟</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期是主播列缺看了2024.4.5号声音玩具乐队在成都举行的“时间之外”演唱会后的激情repo，根据演唱会曲目顺序进行点评，内含大量又骂又夸，请谨慎收听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢接受采访的乐迷朋友们，也感谢跟我一起看这场演出的我的朋友们，每次旅行因为你们而美妙。如有冒犯以及侵权内容，或者什么想解释澄清的，欢迎留言。如果有引起共鸣的部分，也欢迎留言。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 前情提要以及简单介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="895">00:14:55</a> 青春intro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1312">00:21:52</a> 篇章1 “生命是永无休止的旅程？“</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1848">00:30:48</a> 篇章2 “爱是？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2274">00:37:54</a> 篇章3 “我们走不了多远”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2648">00:44:08</a> 篇章4 “欢乐还是痛苦”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3078">00:51:18</a> &nbsp;返场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4338">01:12:18</a> &nbsp;演出结束后的感想、乐迷采访</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5133">01:25:33</a> 漫长的告别</span></p><span></span><p><span>背景音乐：《明天你依旧在我身旁》现场大合唱版</span></p><span></span><p><span>涉及乐队：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="http://music.163.com/artist?id=12711&amp;userid=310549955" data-url="http://music.163.com/artist?id=12711&amp;userid=310549955"><span>声音玩具</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="http://music.163.com/artist?id=12167207&amp;userid=310549955" data-url="http://music.163.com/artist?id=12167207&amp;userid=310549955"><span>隐基底ENGEDI</span></a><span> </span><a href="http://music.163.com/artist?id=12408001&amp;userid=310549955" data-url="http://music.163.com/artist?id=12408001&amp;userid=310549955"><span>完美倒立</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>说再见吧毕竟我们有过，最美妙的旅行。</span></p>]]></description>
